1
00:01:08,450 --> 00:01:13,000
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:15,880
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,840
Could it be that my child didn't die,

4
00:01:22,150 --> 00:01:23,039
but was...

5
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,090
Director Xu,

6
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:14,810
you look so pale.

7
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,520
Are you feeling unwell?

8
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:18,200
Just a bit of a headache.

9
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,210
Much better now.

10
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,079
How do you think I acted just now?

11
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:26,000
Very well.

12
00:02:27,290 --> 00:02:29,820
You completely brought my character
to life.

13
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,160
It's just that while playing this role,

14
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,800
I kept having this strange feeling.

15
00:02:35,079 --> 00:02:35,840
A feeling

16
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,560
that what you wrote wasn't a script,

17
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,590
but my life.

18
00:02:42,410 --> 00:02:43,660
Every detail,

19
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,090
every line of dialogue,

20
00:02:46,050 --> 00:02:47,880
felt so familiar to me.

21
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:49,870
Really?

22
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,190
Maybe

23
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,730
I just wrote it too realistically.

24
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:55,690
You know,

25
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:57,710
art imitates life.

26
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,310
Did you know?

27
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,940
After I was disfigured last time,

28
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,200
my ex-wife gave me a skin graft.

29
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,180
That's why I can continue acting,

30
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:13,070
just like what you wrote in your script.

31
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,470
Ex-wife?

32
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:18,470
She was so good to you.

33
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,680
Why did you separate?

34
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,750
It's strange.

35
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,340
I haven't told anyone about this.

36
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:32,190
But after reading your script...

37
00:03:35,470 --> 00:03:36,870
In the entertainment industry,

38
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,829
you know,

39
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:40,750
many things are out of my control.

40
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,840
But I really miss her.

41
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,360
I miss her voice,

42
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,310
her smile,

43
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:52,190
and the way she looked at me.

44
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,020
So many years have passed.

45
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,079
I still have her number saved,

46
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,810
but I've never had the courage to call.

47
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,200
After all these years apart,

48
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,170
I've never once reached out to her.

49
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:14,430
Director Xu,

50
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:18,940
tell me.

51
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:20,269
The person you thought

52
00:04:20,269 --> 00:04:22,480
had disappeared from your life forever

53
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,730
is actually right by your side.

54
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:28,070
What would you do?

55
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,070
I...

56
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:36,070
I want to call her.

57
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,560
After all these years,

58
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:41,870
I want to hear her voice.

59
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,870
Even if she hung up.

60
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:52,190
Then I'll give you some privacy.

61
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:54,190
No need.

62
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,720
Actually, I'd like to introduce A'lan
to you.

63
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,360
She's my ex-wife.

64
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,300
She'd probably love to know

65
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,390
who it was

66
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,360
that turned our lives into a script.

67
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:09,390
Sure.

68
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,800
A'lan is so innocent

69
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:13,390
and considerate.

70
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,020
Sometimes I think,

71
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,870
if only I could turn back time.

72
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,730
But now,

73
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,160
let the past

74
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:31,800
be the past.

75
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,340
[A'lan]

76
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:52,920
Is that you, Xiao?

77
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,860
Xiao, you've finally remembered me.

78
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,120
Say something, Xiao.

79
00:05:58,390 --> 00:05:59,170
Xiao.

80
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:00,690
Say something, Xiao.

81
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,890
What's wrong, Mr. Zhao?

82
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,870
The call connected.
Why didn't you say anything?

83
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:14,000
Don't tell me you've got cold feet now.

84
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,660
That wasn't A'lan.

85
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:20,070
Maybe she changed her phone number.

86
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:23,230
Someone called you just now too.

87
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:26,030
Want to check if it's something urgent?

88
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:27,600
[Got it. See you in the cemetery.]

89
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,460
Spam call.

90
00:06:30,790 --> 00:06:32,050
Let's go. Time to work.

91
00:06:35,659 --> 00:06:37,270
Scene 7, shot 1, take 1.

92
00:06:35,770 --> 00:06:37,320
[The Husband's Trap]

93
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,080
Jingshu.

94
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:52,680
I'm sorry.

95
00:06:54,470 --> 00:06:55,260
Jingshu.

96
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,680
I'm sorry.

97
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:09,310
Something's off with this color.

98
00:07:09,310 --> 00:07:10,690
Wardrobe, come here!

99
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:14,630
Does this tie come in another color?

100
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:15,360
Yes.

101
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:17,370
Okay. Take him to change it.

102
00:07:17,370 --> 00:07:17,920
Okay.

103
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,920
Change it. This color doesn't work.

104
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:29,390
The second female lead bought her way
into the cast.

105
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:31,370
Bought her way into a short drama?

106
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,880
That seems unnecessary.

107
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,659
Then you don't know the story.

108
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:36,610
She's the male lead's wife.

109
00:07:36,870 --> 00:07:38,630
Acting is secondary.

110
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:41,090
She's really here to keep tabs on him.

111
00:08:02,570 --> 00:08:04,400
Director Xu, I'm sorry.

112
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:06,070
I didn't follow the script just now.

113
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:08,470
Somehow, as I was acting,

114
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,800
it just turned out this way.

115
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,050
I have to say,

116
00:08:11,190 --> 00:08:12,880
the further in we got,

117
00:08:13,070 --> 00:08:14,670
the more I actually believed

118
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,480
it was happening to me.

119
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:21,940
Maybe it's because

120
00:08:21,970 --> 00:08:24,100
ever since I had a child with Zhao Xiao,

121
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:27,660
I've been afraid something like this
might happen.

122
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,530
Director Xu.

123
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:32,710
Director Xu!

124
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,320
Are you talking to me?

125
00:08:37,909 --> 00:08:40,510
Seems like you're still upset with me

126
00:08:40,510 --> 00:08:41,960
about the production halt.

127
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,020
Take these two days off

128
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:44,440
as paid leave.

129
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,640
There's no need to come to the set

130
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,180
just to give me a hard time.

131
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,840
Why would I be mad at you?

132
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:52,570
Actually, I should thank you.

133
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:54,770
I've been prepping a new project,

134
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,480
and with the shoot on hold,

135
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,600
I took Mr. Zhao to meet the investors.

136
00:08:58,790 --> 00:09:00,450
They were very taken with him.

137
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,120
What's wrong?

138
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:09,020
Didn't Mr. Zhao tell you?

139
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,960
I am his agent.

140
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:14,300
All his work arrangements

141
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,990
go through my approval.

142
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:18,440
Of course.

143
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:22,250
But Ms. Lin,

144
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,210
I think you're quite generous.

145
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,570
You kicked me out one second,

146
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:29,320
then let me take Mr. Zhao
to a meeting the next.

147
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:30,440
Ms. Lin,

148
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,080
Mr. Zhao has been

149
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,980
in this industry for so long.

150
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:36,680
Why is he still doing nothing
but short dramas?

151
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,910
Shouldn't you reflect

152
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,100
on your own problems?

153
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,120
If I hadn't pushed Zhao Xiao

154
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,440
to where he is today,

155
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,630
do you think you'd have the chance

156
00:09:43,630 --> 00:09:44,960
to let him be your male lead?

157
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:47,840
But if Mr. Zhao didn't see my value,

158
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:51,160
do you think he would be here right now?

159
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,550
So, Ms. Lin,

160
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:58,070
you'd better think about your next step

161
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,690
before someone beats you to it.

162
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:01,320
You...

163
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,200
Let's roll.

164
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:12,080
What a terrible director.

165
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,480
Not professional at all.

166
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:16,510
She wears heavy makeup
to the set every day.

167
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:18,040
She's not the one on camera.

168
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,470
But Madam,

169
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:20,960
you were wonderful just now.

170
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:23,290
I couldn't tell
you were an amateur at all.

171
00:10:24,150 --> 00:10:25,790
I wasn't really trying just now.

172
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:26,790
Just went with it.

173
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:29,020
Talent is talent.

174
00:10:29,150 --> 00:10:30,240
You blew them away.

175
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,240
Didn't I ask you to investigate Xu Jing?

176
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,720
It's been so long,

177
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,000
and there's no news at all.

178
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,000
I'm sorry, Madam.

179
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,270
I really haven't found anything yet.

180
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,860
The main issue is time.

181
00:10:42,910 --> 00:10:44,080
I can't follow her all the time.

182
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,940
How about this.

183
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,670
This month you're off my detail.

184
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:47,840
Focus on her.

185
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:48,600
Understand?

186
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:49,360
Understood.

187
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,270
Just answer it.

188
00:10:57,570 --> 00:10:59,100
Doesn't it bother you?

189
00:11:00,550 --> 00:11:01,480
Unknown number.

190
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:03,120
Probably a spam call.

191
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,870
Xu Jing.

192
00:11:19,150 --> 00:11:21,240
Zhao Xiao doesn't seem to care much
about that child.

193
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,170
Maybe the child really is adopted.

194
00:11:25,540 --> 00:11:27,170
[Medical Certificate of Birth]

195
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,330
[Medical Certificate of Birth]
[Time of Birth: August 9, 2022]

196
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:34,700
[August 9, 2022]

197
00:11:31,450 --> 00:11:32,780
About your child,

198
00:11:32,810 --> 00:11:33,800
I'm very sorry.

199
00:11:41,950 --> 00:11:43,210
What's wrong, Xu Jing?

200
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:47,670
Qiao.

201
00:11:50,630 --> 00:11:51,480
Xiaoxiao,

202
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,150
my child.

203
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:55,840
Are you suspecting that...
